#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:5
msgid "Define cell content"
msgstr "定义单元格内容"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ allows defining two different types of "
"content in a `text cell`_ type:"
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 允许在 `文本单元格 <text cell_>`_ "
"类型中定义两种不同类型的内容："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:10
msgid "**Plain text**"
msgstr "**纯文本**"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:11
msgid "**Variable**"
msgstr "**变量**"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works managing different database, the content of the `cells`_ "
"are storage in the project database. QElectroTech provides the feature of "
"defining the cell content in different languages, the cell content is "
"defined in a cell value table. The content from the different `cells`_ of "
"the `title block`_ are automatically displayed in the language defined."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 通过管理不同的数据库来工作，`单元格 <cells_>`_ 的内容存储在项目数据库中。QElectroTech "
"提供了用不同语言定义单元格内容的功能，单元格内容在单元格值表中定义。`图框 <title block_>`_ 中不同 `单元格 <cells_>`_ "
"的内容会以所定义的语言自动显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:20
msgid ""
"The working language from QElectroTech is defined at **Setting > Configure "
"QElectroTech**."
msgstr "QElectroTech 的工作语言在 **设置 > 配置 QElectroTech** 中定义。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:23
msgid "Add text to cell"
msgstr "向单元格添加文本"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:25
msgid "Select the `cell`_ where the text should be introduced."
msgstr "选择要输入文本的 `单元格 <cell_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:26
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:84
msgid ""
"Press **Edit** button from text field and the cell value PopUP window will "
"be displayed."
msgstr "单击文本字段旁的 **编辑** 按钮，将显示单元格值弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:85
msgid ""
"Press the button **Add a line** to add a new row in the cell value table."
msgstr "单击 **添加一行** 按钮，在单元格值表中添加新行。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:28
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:78
msgid ""
"Define the 2 letter code that identifies the language from the text at "
"**Language** column."
msgstr "在 **语言** 栏中填写标识文本语言的两位字母代码。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:29
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:79
msgid "Define the text at **Text** column."
msgstr "在 **文本** 栏中填写文本。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:30
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:80
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:94
msgid "Press **OK**"
msgstr "按 **确定**"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:34
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works according `ISO 639-1`_ norm. The text language is defined"
" using 2 letter code which should be used at the language column from the "
"cell value table."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 遵循 `ISO 639-1 <ISO 639-1_>`_ "
"规范。文本语言使用两位字母代码来定义，该代码应在单元格值表的语言栏中填写。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, cell label PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，单元格标签弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:43
msgid "Add variable to cell"
msgstr "向单元格添加变量"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:45
msgid ""
"A title block variable is the value of a project or folio property. At "
"QElectroTech, a variable is called using the percent symbol before the "
"variable name (``%{variable-name}``)."
msgstr ""
"图框变量是项目或图幅属性的值。在 QElectroTech 中，变量通过在变量名前加百分号来调用（``%{variable-name}`` ）。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:50
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has some default variables that the user does not need to "
"create (ex.: ``%{author}``, ``%{date}``, ``%{title}``, ``%{folio}``, "
"``%{projecttitle}``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了一些用户无需创建的默认变量（例如 ``%{author}`` 、``%{date}`` 、``%{title}`` "
"、``%{folio}`` 、``%{projecttitle}`` 等）。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:53
msgid "QElectroTech also allows the user defining extra variables:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 还允许用户定义额外的变量："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:55
msgid ""
"Go to **Project > Project properties > General** to define customized "
"project variables."
msgstr "转到 **项目 > 项目属性 > 常规** 以定义自定义项目变量。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:56
msgid ""
"Go to **Edit > Folio properties > Title block information > Custom**  to "
"define customized folio variables."
msgstr "转到 **编辑 > 图幅属性 > 图框信息 > 自定义** 以定义自定义图幅变量。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:58
msgid "QElectroTech allows that the cell has a **Label** for the variable."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许单元格为变量设置 **标签** 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:60
msgid "To define the label:"
msgstr "要定义标签："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:62
msgid "Select the `cell`_ where the variable should be introduced."
msgstr "选择要输入变量的 `单元格 <cell_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:63
msgid ""
"Click the button **Display a label** to introduce a label in the cell. Click"
" on the button and go to variable definition if the **Label** should not be "
"displayed."
msgstr "单击 **显示标签** 按钮，在单元格中添加标签。如果不需要显示 **标签** ，请单击该按钮将其关闭，然后转到变量定义。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:68
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block text cell properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框文本单元格属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:70
msgid ""
"Press **Edit** button from label field and the label value PopUP window will"
" be displayed."
msgstr "单击标签字段旁的 **编辑** 按钮，将显示标签值弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:75
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:92
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, cell value PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，单元格值弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:77
msgid ""
"Press the button **Add a line** to add a new row in the Label value table."
msgstr "单击 **添加一行** 按钮，在标签值表中添加新行。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:82
msgid "To define the variable:"
msgstr "要定义变量："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:86
msgid ""
"Define the 2 letter code that identifies the language from the text at "
"**Language** column. Defining only one language is enough for default "
"variables."
msgstr "在 **语言** 栏中填写标识文本语言的两位字母代码。对于默认变量，只需定义一种语言即可。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:87
msgid ""
"Define the variable at **Text** column. A variable is defined as "
"``%{variable-name}``. The default variables can be copied to clipboard at "
"the right bottom Combo Box and pasted (``Ctrl + c``) in **Text** column "
"cell."
msgstr ""
"在 **文本** 栏中定义变量。变量写作 ``%{variable-name}`` 。可从右下角的组合框将默认变量复制到剪贴板，然后粘贴（``Ctrl "
"+ c`` ）到 **文本** 栏的单元格中。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_value.rst:98
msgid ""
"For more information about default variables, refer to `default QElectroTech"
" variables`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关默认变量的更多信息，请参阅 `默认 QElectroTech 变量 <default QElectroTech variables_>`_ 一节。"
